      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-294707",
      ":question/problem": "A freelance designer charges a base project fee of $b$ dollars and earns a performance bonus worth $15%$ of the total value $v$ of client contracts secured through their designs. For the next project, the designer wants the total earnings to be no less than $1.45$ times and no more than $2.5$ times the base project fee. Which inequality shows all possible values of $v$ that meet this goal?"
